if mibBuilder.loadTexts: ciscoWanCesConnMIB.setDescription('The MIB module to configure the Circuit Emulation\n        connections in MGX82xx series products.\n\n        Terminology:\n        CES                : Circuit Emulation Service.\n                             The CES defines a method of\n                             carrying a traffic from non-ATM telephony\n                             devices over an ATM cloud. The CES provides\n                             an interworking function(IWF) that allows\n                             the two protocols to communicate.\n        channel , endpoint : channel and connection endpoint \n                             have same meaning and are used \n                             interchangebly.\n        DAX Connection     : Digital Access and Cross-connect connection\n                             is a connection where master and slave\n                             endpoints are with in the same MGX shelf.\n        CAS                : Channel Associated Signaling. This\n                             is in-band signaling.\n        CCS                : Common Channel Signaling. This is\n                             is out-of-band signaling.')
